<title>ITALY: Fiat to make one-for-10 bonus share issue.</title>
<headline>Fiat to make one-for-10 bonus share issue.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiat SpA is to make a one-for-10 bonus share issue for holders of all types of shares, a spokesman for the company said.</p>
<p>The proposed bonus issue is expected to be presented to shareholders for approval at the annual meeting, usually held in June.</p>
<p>Beneficiaries of the bonus issue would be entitled to a dividend payout from the 1997 reporting year.</p>
